#: source/php/AcfFields/php/pre-school-data.php:36
msgid "Upload a maximum of 6 images in jpg/landscape format of the preschool's facade from different angles, such as the entrance and the yard/backside. Best displayed in 16:9 format. Add captions to explain the image to the visitor."
